items.headline:
During a journey from Abu Dhabi to Fujairah on 
@etihad_rail
's passenger train, Nahyan bin Mubarak praised efforts in delivering the project, which provides safe, fast and sustainable transport, linking cities, and supporting commercial and tourism movement across the UAE.

Nahyan bin Mubarak has boarded 
@Etihad_Rail
’s passenger train on a journey from Mohamed bin Zayed City Station in Abu Dhabi to Fujairah Station, expressing his pride in the launch of the train, which represents a transformative milestone in the transport sector.

The Cultural Foundation, under 
@dctabudhabi
, has launched Shezad Dawood’s Skin of Dreams exhibition, presenting the full breadth of his interdisciplinary practice and the premiere of the final two episodes of his Leviathan Cycle film series.
